  "title": "Pakistani Lentil Curry",
  "description": "This cheap and very easy Pakistani meal is usually eaten with Basmati rice, tossed salad, and hot pickles. It is relatively quick to make, and tastes even better the second day.",
  "authors": [
    "jerry javed"
  ],
